{
  "groups": {
    "r1-asi": {
      "description": "R2 方向 A 专用 cases：换行后的 `{` 是块起点时必须在 ASI 边界收口（`let a = 1` ⏎ `{ b; }`），同时不得切断函数/类/箭头/类型字面量/控制体的 `{`。每条都与 ts.createSourceFile 逐节点对拍；forceShell=true 钉住新壳路径，skipLegacyCompare=true 因为 legacy 同缺陷已被有意让位。",
      "needs": [],
      "cases": [
        {
          "name": "r1-bare-block",
          "source": "let a = 1\n{ b; }",
          "forceShell": true,
          "skipLegacyCompare": true,
          "note": "坏形：声明后换行块（原 THROW 表达式语句没有读完）"
        },
        {
          "name": "r1-empty-block",
          "source": "let a = 1\n{}",
          "forceShell": true,
          "skipLegacyCompare": true,
          "note": "坏形：空块跟在声明后"
        },
        {
          "name": "r1-decl-block",
          "source": "let a = 1\n{ let b = 2; }",
          "forceShell": true,
          "skipLegacyCompare": true,
          "note": "坏形：块内还有声明"
        },
        {
          "name": "r1-ctrl-function-expr",
          "source": "const f = function ()\n{ }",
          "forceShell": true,
          "skipLegacyCompare": true,
          "note": "对照：函数表达式体（开头等体，不是 ASI）"
        },
        {
          "name": "r1-ctrl-arrow-block",
          "source": "const f = () =>\n{ }",
          "forceShell": true,
          "skipLegacyCompare": true,
          "note": "对照：箭头体（开头等体）"
        },
        {
          "name": "r1-ctrl-type-literal",
          "source": "let a: {\n  x: number\n} = { x: 1 }",
          "forceShell": true,
          "skipLegacyCompare": true,
          "note": "对照：类型注解里的对象类型字面量"
        },
        {
          "name": "r1-expr-then-block",
          "source": "a\n{}",
          "forceShell": true,
          "skipLegacyCompare": true,
          "note": "表达式语句后换行块"
        },
        {
          "name": "r1-if-same-line",
          "source": "let a = 1\nif (a) {}",
          "forceShell": true,
          "skipLegacyCompare": true,
          "note": "声明后换行 if（原本就绿）"
        },
        {
          "name": "r1-empty-stmt",
          "source": "let a=1\n;\n{b;}",
          "forceShell": true,
          "skipLegacyCompare": true,
          "note": "行首空语句分号后接块"
        },
        {
          "name": "r1-fn-body-then-block",
          "source": "function f() { }\n{ b; }",
          "forceShell": true,
          "skipLegacyCompare": true,
          "note": "函数体已闭合后换行块（不被 function 误判等体）"
        },
        {
          "name": "r1-class-body",
          "source": "class A\n{ }",
          "forceShell": true,
          "skipLegacyCompare": true,
          "note": "对照：class 体跨行"
        },
        {
          "name": "r1-class-extends",
          "source": "class A extends B\n{ }",
          "forceShell": true,
          "skipLegacyCompare": true,
          "note": "对照：extends 后换行体"
        },
        {
          "name": "r1-interface-body",
          "source": "interface A\n{ }",
          "forceShell": true,
          "skipLegacyCompare": true,
          "note": "对照：interface 体跨行"
        },
        {
          "name": "r1-for-body",
          "source": "for (;;)\n{ }",
          "forceShell": true,
          "skipLegacyCompare": true,
          "note": "对照：for 体跨行"
        },
        {
          "name": "r1-declare-decl",
          "source": "declare let a=1\n{}",
          "forceShell": true,
          "skipLegacyCompare": true,
          "note": "未覆盖：declare 声明后换行块"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
